    "body": "Why, not allowing to call an external program?\r\n\r\nYou have the shell, one of the most powerful scripting language, which is obviously available, with little, if no, learning curve...\r\n\r\nExample suggestion:\r\n\r\n```toml\r\n# ~/.config/starship.toml\r\n\r\n[azure]\r\ndisabled = false\r\nafter_script = \"myprogram \\\"$subscription\\\"\"\r\nformat = \"[$symbol($stdout)]($style)\"\r\nstyle = \"blue bold\"\r\n```\r\n",
