    "updated_at": "2022-04-06T05:12:52Z",
    "body": "Hi, thanks for the multi-platform and portability argument. It makes sense in this context of portability of the project to abstract the scripting language for such reason. One language or another would probably go more into \"religious\" like preference, or personal habit.  \r\n\r\nCould someone craft a sample of config, the way you wish it'd look like? An imaginary config with scripting embedded?\r\n\r\nEspecially using the mentioned use-case:  \r\n* readability / accessibility for new developers\r\n* ability to expose starship-internal functionality to the script\r\n* not to fall into: scripts hardly readable, very poor maintainability \r\n",
